# Everyday Punjabi

Self-serve **Learn** track. Product title **Everyday Punjabi**; route track id `"free"`. Fuller notes: `docs/everyday-punjabi.md`.

## Where it sits

- Bottom nav **Learn** → `/dashboard/learn` → first card → `/dashboard/learn/free`
- Sibling Learn tracks: Foundational / Beginners (paid lesson lists) — **different product surface**
- Paid **Community** track id `"community"` is live/package weeks — **not** this mastery path (even though free topics load from `COMMUNITY_COURSE_ID`)
- **Games** tab is separate; practice reuses Match / quiz / tiles / speak patterns but writes `topic_mastery`
- **Kids** is separate (`/dashboard/kids`)

## What it is

24 community topics (`COMMUNITY_COURSE_ID`). Path of topic nodes → topic hub → practice games that level **Vocab → Sentences → Speaking**. Master a topic (all three stages) → purple shiny badge.

## Mastery (do not invent a different model)

- 3 stages × 5 depths (0–4 attempt; depth 5 = stage complete)
- Rings: yellow Vocab → green Sentences → purple Speaking
- Fully mastered = all fills 100% → solid purple icon + shine (`.topic-mastery-*` in `globals.css`)
- Persist via `topic_mastery` (`src/lib/free-lessons/mastery.ts`) — do **not** write mastery into `lesson_progress` PDF fields
- Unlock: sequence (prev topic mastery ≥ 1) + Premium for `!is_free` lessons — Premium does **not** skip sequence

## Practice kinds

Orchestrator: `TopicGamePractice` + `resolveTopicGameActivity` in `activity-games.ts`.

| Stage | Activities |
|-------|------------|
| Vocab | match, speed_quiz (incl. reverse) |
| Sentences | tiles |
| Speaking | speak (fallback tiles if &lt;2 speakable cards) |

Optional hub helpers: `/vocab` browse, `/sentences` builder (not primary stage scorer).

## UX rules to keep

1. Romanisation under Gurmukhi (`PunjabiWithRomanisation`)
2. MCQ: select → **Check answer** → then Continue (no instant lock-in)
3. Listen: normal + **Slow** (0.8×) on `TopicListenButton`
4. Tiles ≈ Games Sentence Builder: tap built tile to return; restore `bankIndex` order
5. Speak: retry after miss; after 2 fails → Try again or Skip
6. Results **Try again** = client remount (`runKey`) — no mastery rollback
7. Hub: no “X of Y words reviewed” pressure — vocab is optional

## Key paths

- UI: `src/components/learn/`
- Logic: `src/lib/free-lessons/`
- Routes: `src/app/dashboard/learn/free/`
- Actions: `src/app/dashboard/learn/free/actions.ts`

## Do not

- Change Foundational/Beginners slides / `LearnLessonList` for Everyday Punjabi work
- Treat track `"free"` as “all topics free” — Premium still gates paid lessons
- Reintroduce hub vocab review counts
- Casually diverge Learn tiles from Games Sentence Builder tile/`bankIndex` UX
